   Index Cond: ((sdate >= '01-04-1995'::date) AND (sdate <= '01-05-1995'::date) AND (item_class = ANY ('{1,3,5}'::integer[])) AND (store = ANY ('{2,3}'::integer[])))
   Buffers: shared hit=2
(3 rows)

